#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:1 fd0c8e349e12479ea68cb061609abdd9
msgid "The Black-Scholes world"
msgstr "Black-Scholes 的世界"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:3 fb144a25858c4cd5bc2758e1bade0107
msgid ""
"Every equity engine in this build prices in one model: a single asset "
"following geometric Brownian motion under the risk-neutral measure,"
msgstr "這個版本中的每一個股權引擎都在同一個模型裡計價：單一資產在風險中立測度下服從幾何布朗運動，"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:6 44c6681654704e46bc805dbc6367c1d2
msgid "dS_t = (r - q)\\,S_t\\,dt + \\sigma S_t\\,dW_t ."
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:8 765ce4ad671441e3b78caa37a0bc7237
msgid ""
"The three **processes** the underlying card offers are three ways of "
"filling in that drift."
msgstr "標的卡片提供的三種**隨機過程**，是填入那個漂移項的三種方式。"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md ce82689242904a4883ad4d195cd08765
msgid "Process"
msgstr "隨機過程"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md b827f079f21d4c93bbd576bb76394e15
msgid "Drift"
msgstr "漂移"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md 359f635b2fb24be5b031b5ec19979b5d
msgid "Use"
msgstr "用途"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md b71e2b9f071645c1ae4c76b725b843a5
msgid "Black-Scholes-Merton"
msgstr "Black-Scholes-Merton"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md 6047aaeb6db34dfe972db81db277ad16
msgid "$r - q$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md d7e6d226eabb4d72857ee6c039599ee3
msgid "An equity with a dividend yield. The default"
msgstr "帶股利收益率的股權。預設值"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md 4139a47ed0714706aea7a9ee6faf9334
msgid "Black-Scholes"
msgstr "Black-Scholes"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md 6724a5bdff534bd7b877735406bca3fb
msgid "$r$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md 1c740aabf8c64168ad94f6dd9df3502b
msgid "No dividends. A dividend curve is *rejected*, not ignored"
msgstr "無股利。股利曲線會被*拒絕*，而不是被忽略"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md 5d9700df047a4a8e905830669df96893
msgid "Black"
msgstr "Black"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md f561d3067225450da4ed6902fb9dbf68
msgid "$0$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md f7eee328a99d494781f276e7caad62ff
msgid "The forward is the state variable: $q = r$, so $F = S$. Options on futures"
msgstr "遠期價就是狀態變數：$q = r$，因此 $F = S$。期貨選擇權"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:17 85867b4dbd3f4102b5a97d4d804272af
msgid "The equation"
msgstr "方程式"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:19 e3d543b3dfcd4115b9e1d04e15284dba
msgid "Under that process a claim's value $V(S,t)$ satisfies"
msgstr "在該過程之下，一項請求權的價值 $V(S,t)$ 滿足"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:21 7223fc37e08e428da5c617db022833ed
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\frac{\\partial V}{\\partial t}\n"
"  + \\tfrac{1}{2}\\sigma^2 S^2 \\frac{\\partial^2 V}{\\partial S^2}\n"
"  + (r-q)\\,S\\,\\frac{\\partial V}{\\partial S}\n"
"  - rV = 0,"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:26 e7cf86b3107c436f8023478a9acc5b45
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"with the payoff as terminal condition at $t = T$. Every method in "
"{doc}`../HANDLERS` is a way of solving that equation:"
msgstr "並以收益函數作為 $t = T$ 的終端條件。{doc}`../HANDLERS` 中的每一種方法，都是求解這個方程式的一種方式："

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:29 ea4e14be703f4582a602debcbb1ad784
msgid ""
"**analytic** — the closed form below, when the boundary conditions admit "
"one;"
msgstr "**解析解**——當邊界條件容許時，就是下面的封閉解；"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:30 d09024c2595349dc817a62f3e4a47cb2
msgid ""
"**lattice** — a discrete approximation of the same process, solved "
"backwards;"
msgstr "**格點**——同一個過程的離散近似，由後往前求解；"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:31 fe96a71beee340d184a768164e235eeb
msgid "**finite difference** — the equation itself, discretised on a grid;"
msgstr "**有限差分**——方程式本身，在網格上離散化；"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:32 bee0747853f24827892a81538bd6456c
msgid "**Monte Carlo** — the equivalent expectation, sampled;"
msgstr "**蒙地卡羅**——等價的期望值，用抽樣求得；"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:33 23e403a96b9d4d998e8e72eddceaabfb
msgid ""
"**integral** — the expectation as a numerical quadrature over the "
"terminal density."
msgstr "**數值積分**——把期望值當成對期末機率密度的數值求積。"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:36 08d4b8ea0e524101bc24b7e0baec3232
msgid ""
"They are approximations of one another, which is why comparing two "
"engines on the same trade is a meaningful check and why the result always"
" echoes which one ran."
msgstr "它們互為近似，這也是為什麼在同一筆交易上比較兩個引擎是有意義的檢查，以及為什麼結果永遠回音報出實際跑的是哪一個。"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:40 57df216b9da2474aa829f49c78ab9b44
msgid "The closed form"
msgstr "封閉解"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:42 e7c7c3eec94b47f6b8055aab6de7aa2d
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"For a European payoff the solution is the Black-Scholes formula. QuantLib"
" computes it in *forward and discount* form rather than from $r$ and $q$ "
"directly — this is `BlackCalculator`, driven by the forward $F = "
"S\\,D_q/D_r$, the standard deviation $v = \\sigma\\sqrt{T}$ and the "
"discount $D_r$:"
msgstr "對歐式收益函數，解就是 Black-Scholes 公式。QuantLib 以*遠期價與折現因子*的形式計算它，而不是直接由 $r$ 與 $q$ 出發——這就是 `BlackCalculator`，由遠期價 $F = S\\,D_q/D_r$、標準差 $v = \\sigma\\sqrt{T}$ 與折現因子 $D_r$ 驅動："

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:48 bebc50b0b91f4e0e9e4f49a4a2318f0d
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"d_1 = \\frac{\\ln(F/K)}{v} + \\frac{v}{2},\n"
"\\qquad d_2 = d_1 - v,"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:51 74a748192b2e46bbbaf25d54b9512d75
msgid ""
"c = D_r\\big[F\\,N(d_1) - K\\,N(d_2)\\big],\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"p = D_r\\big[K\\,N(-d_2) - F\\,N(-d_1)\\big]."
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:55 07c5b5f1b6104b688bb1898ec69030bc
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Substituting $F = Se^{(r-q)T}$ and $D_r = e^{-rT}$ recovers the textbook "
"form,"
msgstr "代入 $F = Se^{(r-q)T}$ 與 $D_r = e^{-rT}$ 即可還原教科書形式，"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:57 b11d49594f51409f92af612b67593642
msgid ""
"c = S e^{-qT} N(d_1) - K e^{-rT} N(d_2),\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"d_1 = \\frac{\\ln(S/K) + (r - q + "
"\\tfrac{1}{2}\\sigma^2)T}{\\sigma\\sqrt{T}},"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:61 fe0cd2f320f74415a8e0310cd11e591a
msgid ""
"but the forward form is the one to reason with here, because the forward "
"and the discount are what the curves actually supply."
msgstr "但在這裡該用來推理的是遠期價形式，因為曲線實際提供的正是遠期價與折現因子。"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:64 e00c469269b7421d8b4179d5bd9b5e99
msgid "Put-call parity"
msgstr "賣權買權平價"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:66 c37e60c7f3e14edba81ab6ca7018dbb1
#, python-brace-format
msgid "c - p = D_r(F - K) = S e^{-qT} - K e^{-rT}."
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:68 691ecaf8632c4a2aa0315055a0a7b301
msgid ""
"Worth keeping to hand: it is the cheapest sanity check on a market that "
"has just been re-authored, and it holds for the European vanilla prices "
"this service returns to the last digit."
msgstr "值得隨手備著：對剛重新編寫過的市場而言，這是最便宜的合理性檢查，而且對本服務回傳的歐式一般型價格，它成立到最後一位數字。"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:72 2b69bcb0065643dab4ce23aff8fae234
msgid "The other payoffs"
msgstr "其他收益函數"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:74 75a5d508ca7f4ce59339e82aea3d9b76
msgid ""
"The same machinery prices the other payoffs, because each is a "
"combination of the two terms above evaluated at one strike or two. Write"
msgstr "同一套機制也為其他收益函數計價，因為每一個都是上面兩項在一個或兩個履約價上求值後的組合。令"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:77 aa617b0045ca43f5bc5197a77545eecd
msgid ""
"\\Phi(K) = N\\big(d_2(K)\\big), \\qquad A(K) = D_r "
"F\\,N\\big(d_1(K)\\big) = S D_q N\\big(d_1(K)\\big),"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:79 4512183cdd4b4206ad9582ed4d9b8fe8
msgid ""
"so $\\Phi(K)$ is the risk-neutral probability of finishing above $K$ and "
"$A(K)$ is the present value of receiving the asset itself in that event:"
msgstr "於是 $\\Phi(K)$ 是到期落在 $K$ 之上的風險中立機率，而 $A(K)$ 是在該事件中收到資產本身的現值："

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md 034e26662e84430d9e746b2dfae98116
msgid "Payoff"
msgstr "收益函數"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md 8d309b4208c84598a4acee83753eef1a
msgid "Terminal payoff (call form)"
msgstr "期末收益（買權形式）"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md 1485b916c5c845348c99023f922b5e69
msgid "Value"
msgstr "價值"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md d35fd2f2b79f4320ad7bd9e138744e92
msgid "plain vanilla"
msgstr "一般型"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md 72c14013c3414b5a87750f99128b6598
msgid "$\\max(S_T - K, 0)$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md c685aba17fca4073b6c85a5dfd4b84e0
msgid "$A(K) - K D_r \\Phi(K)$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md 51f34e108a634864bc1d56fcd9ee6a1f
msgid "asset-or-nothing"
msgstr "資產或零"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md 3dc0d86110674716910773c0ba85b008
msgid "$S_T$ if $S_T \\ge K$"
msgstr "若 $S_T \\ge K$ 則為 $S_T$"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md 6e43677864da4d32a6e8e1cae8880cdb
msgid "$A(K)$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md 1ee5c612fa374f0f8ec04eaef21524f5
msgid "cash-or-nothing"
msgstr "現金或零"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md 3f38bcdfbee84a57934d6f42e3d01a34
msgid "$X$ if $S_T \\ge K$"
msgstr "若 $S_T \\ge K$ 則為 $X$"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md ddcf35b6979946f1bff7e112bcb54e51
msgid "$X D_r \\Phi(K)$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md 9b55e7ed1aa94d42a9479477f27ac0e8
msgid "gap"
msgstr "缺口"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md 832ff13fa7a24b5f90919587f4fbadaa
msgid "$S_T - K_2$ if $S_T \\ge K_1$"
msgstr "若 $S_T \\ge K_1$ 則為 $S_T - K_2$"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md 5f8871666a444cb9a3dbeeabf97a8a90
msgid "$A(K_1) - K_2 D_r \\Phi(K_1)$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md 61571aab56804b2fb69f8bbe1fef23f2
msgid "super-fund"
msgstr "超級基金"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md 8f2e3f06dd2842b88c1a8b5473265c91
msgid "$S_T/K_1$ if $K_1 \\le S_T < K_2$"
msgstr "若 $K_1 \\le S_T < K_2$ 則為 $S_T/K_1$"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md 4953a222dbf34be39030b53459958859
msgid "$\\big(A(K_1) - A(K_2)\\big)/K_1$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md df76024fa5b546ae9a5e89280d0f3bfc
msgid "super-share"
msgstr "超級股份"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md 55820d3853f4458d80f2e5c3c52f22e8
msgid "$X$ if $K_1 \\le S_T < K_2$"
msgstr "若 $K_1 \\le S_T < K_2$ 則為 $X$"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md b15ffa8eb0a248df84e43b235060dafd
msgid "$X D_r\\big(\\Phi(K_1) - \\Phi(K_2)\\big)$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md 596a41fb443c475687ef6c9cb84baa15
msgid "percentage strike"
msgstr "百分比履約價"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md e87a19e4f6454761a36388f4d133c80c
msgid "$S_T \\max(1 - m, 0)$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md 2c07eee58e144ad2ac7a1386a32e87e0
msgid "$\\max(1-m,0)\\,S D_q$"
msgstr ""

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md f7e315e7c0d444c596300130b122aeb5
msgid "floating"
msgstr "浮動"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md 3e069c88fe7446ee86f9dd7aa0c8f18a
msgid "the extremum is the strike"
msgstr "極值就是履約價"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md ee6e180696054589af0419b7a82cc4d5
#, python-brace-format
msgid "lookbacks only ({doc}`exotics`)"
msgstr "僅限回顧式（{doc}`exotics`）"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:93 1d6f2cbe643743329f8e77ca455bf32f
msgid ""
"The **gap** payoff is the one to read twice: $K_1$ decides whether the "
"option pays and $K_2$ decides how much, so it can pay a negative amount "
"and is not worth $\\max(S-K,0)$ for any single strike."
msgstr "**缺口**收益函數要讀兩遍：$K_1$ 決定選擇權是否給付，$K_2$ 決定給付多少，因此它可能付出負值，而且不等於任何單一履約價下的 $\\max(S-K,0)$。"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:97 0a1c03f2399c4f30baf647b1693bb1f2
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The **percentage strike** payoff has no optionality on its own — its "
"payoff is linear in $S_T$, so a call is worth $\\max(1-m,0)$ of a "
"forward. It exists to be paired with a forward-start exercise, where the "
"engine sets the strike to $m\\,S_{t_1}$ at the reset date "
"({doc}`exotics`)."
msgstr "**百分比履約價**收益函數本身沒有選擇權性質——它的收益對 $S_T$ 是線性的，因此買權值 $\\max(1-m,0)$ 個遠期合約。它存在的目的是與遠期起始履約搭配，屆時引擎會在重設日把履約價設為 $m\\,S_{t_1}$（{doc}`exotics`）。"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:102 afd61dcf64754cc481c6fb4e36f78ec3
msgid "Where this stops"
msgstr "界線在哪裡"

#: ../../maths/black-scholes.md:104 e4c485d713ac4dc58b98bc5aa04860a3
msgid ""
"The model has one volatility per expiry and strike, no jumps, no "
"stochastic volatility and no local volatility surface. Heston, Bates and "
"local-vol processes are in the schema and are **not built**, so a price "
"from this service is always a Black-Scholes price — including the "
"exotics, whose closed forms are derived inside the same model."
msgstr "這個模型對每個到期日與履約價只有一個波動率，沒有跳躍、沒有隨機波動率、也沒有局部波動率曲面。Heston、Bates 與局部波動率過程存在於結構描述中但**沒有實作**，因此本服務給出的價格永遠是 Black-Scholes 價格——包括那些新奇選擇權，它們的封閉解也是在同一個模型內推導出來的。"

